S(font: Arial,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240918183501-03'00')/NM(307836cabaec465cb2dae4cf3ecee1a4)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="text-align:justify;font-family:Arial">An eye of draconian appearance, speculated by witnesses as originating from a creature akin to a basilisk, with a reddish iris, black sclera\ and yellow retinal veins. It weighs 132g and it has approximately the size of an apple. An ominous aura constantly emanates of it.</span></p></body>)/Rect[432.253 225.905 573.674 339.515]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj33 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Unknown, presumably not friendly.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240918182247-03'00')/NM(bb138ce29a0f43518600d4a0c15c9228)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Unknown, presumably not friendly.</span></p></body>)/Rect[224.51 263.845 390.111 288.267]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj34 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents( In case an individual ever picks it up, they are immediately overwhelmed with a sense of danger and alertness, and a secret condition is placed on them without warning or consent. If contact with the individual is in any way broken by the individual, the\y die immediately and their body is instantly and painfully disintegrated, leaving no traces. It is unknown if destruction is possible, and many tried, but very few can report its existence on the forums.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Arial 10 Tf)/DS(font: Arial,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240918183539-03'00')/NM(d7acb930cdb148c288da8a71ac95f1c3)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Arial;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="text-align:justify"> In case an individual ever picks it up, they are immediately overwhelmed with a sense of danger and alertness, and a secret condition is placed on them without warning\ or consent. If contact with the individual is in any way broken by the individual, they die immediately and their body is instantly and painfully disintegrated, leaving no traces. It is unknown if destruction is possible, and many tried, but very few can\ report its existence on the forums.</span></p></body>)/Rect[45.3301 160.864 571.302 206.874]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj35 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(                                                                                                           Notes\r)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 0 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Helv 17.1 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 17.1pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240918183620-03'00')/NM(5f15e8eb9fc54a00959a0547e7205bd6)/Page 3/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:17.1pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica"